---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import ClosingCTA from "../components/ClosingCTA.astro";
import { customConsultationHref, customAutomationSteps, customAutomationFaqs } from "../../shared/custom-automation";
import "../styles/solutions.css";
import "../styles/custom-automation.css";
---
<Base title="Custom Business Automation | Cyber Pirate Labs" description="Custom process automation around your business needs and existing systems. Platform and tech-stack agnostic, with feasibility, testing and an agreed scope.">
  <section class="solutions-hub-intro custom-intro"><div class="wrap"><nav class="solution-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/solutions/">Ten core solutions</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>Custom automation</span></nav><div class="custom-intro-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal-dot"></span>A different workflow deserves a considered solution</p><h1>Your business problem.<br /><span>A useful software solution.</span></h1><p class="hero-summary">When your process falls outside our ten core services, start with a custom automation consultation. We explore the work you want to improve and define a feasible software approach around your business.</p><div class="custom-offer-actions"><a class="button" href={customConsultationHref}>Request a custom consultation <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#custom-process">See the process <span aria-hidden="true">&darr;</span></a></div></div><aside class="custom-path-card"><p class="eyebrow">Start with what matters</p><h2>Where does work<br />get stuck?</h2><p>A repeated task. A gap between systems. An approval that loses its context. Describe the process and the useful outcome you want.</p><p class="custom-path-note">Consultation first. Implementation depends on discovery, access, technical feasibility, security and an approved scope.</p></aside></div></div></section>
  <section class="wrap custom-possibilities"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Examples to assess</p><h2>Less repeated work.<br /><span>More useful flow.</span></h2></div><p>These are starting points for a discussion. Each proposed connection and behavior must be checked for your systems and agreed scope.</p></div><div class="custom-example-grid"><article><span>01 / INFORMATION</span><h3>Connect the right details.</h3><p>Explore moving approved information between the tools your team already uses, when their APIs and permissions support it.</p></article><article><span>02 / COORDINATION</span><h3>Keep the process moving.</h3><p>Assess repeatable routing, follow-up or approval steps, with clear ownership and a human path for exceptions.</p></article><article><span>03 / REPEATED TASKS</span><h3>Reduce manual handoffs.</h3><p>Review recurring checks, record updates or prepared reports that take time away from the work your team needs to do.</p></article></div><p class="custom-example-note">An example is not a promise of an available integration or a guaranteed result. Budget, timeline, supported systems, data handling and acceptance checks are established during discovery.</p></section>
  <section class="custom-process-section" id="custom-process"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">From the process to the approved implementation</p><h2>Understand it.<br /><span>Then build it well.</span></h2></div><p>We agree the outcome and the boundaries before implementation. Testing and the support plan are part of the scope.</p></div><ol class="custom-process">{customAutomationSteps.map((step,index)=><li><span>{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{step.title}</h3><p>{step.text}</p></li>)}</ol></div></section>
  <section class="wrap custom-technology"><div><p class="eyebrow">Technology follows the job</p><h2>The outcome<br /><span>comes first.</span></h2></div><div><p>We solve business problems with software solutions. Custom process automation starts with your needs and existing systems; AI can enable useful steps where appropriate.</p><p>CPL is platform and tech-stack agnostic. We choose tools and integrations around your requirements, available APIs, authorized access and agreed scope. Stammer AI is one option when it fits the solution.</p><a class="text-link" href="/solutions/">Explore the ten core solutions <span aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="faq-section"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before we begin</p><h2>A clear scope.<br /><span>A considered commitment.</span></h2><p>Bring the business problem. We will work through the practical requirements.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{customAutomationFaqs.map(faq=><details><summary>{faq.q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{faq.a}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>
  <ClosingCTA title="Have a workflow worth improving?" text="Tell us where work gets stuck and the outcome you want. Start with a custom automation consultation." href={customConsultationHref} label="Request a consultation" eyebrow="Beyond the ten core solutions" />
</Base>
